# SDKs kLog

Monorepo Turborepo: seis clientes de ingesta. Org: `kriverdevice`. Team/producto: `klog`.

```bash
npm install
npm run check
```

- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` — calidad; no publica.
- `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — publicación a registries.

| Carpeta | Qué es |
|---------|--------|
| `javascript/` | `@kriverdevice/klog-core`, `@kriverdevice/klog-node`, `@kriverdevice/klog-web` |
| `go/` | `github.com/klog-platform/klog-sdks/go` |
| `python/` | `klog-sdk` / `klog_sdk` |
| `php/` | `kriverdevice/klog-sdk-php` |
| `java/` | `com.kriverdevice:klog-sdk` |
| `esp/` | Arduino / ESP-IDF |

## Agentes

| Feature | Agente |
|---------|--------|
| SDKs | `klog-sdks` |
| Ingesta | `klog-ingesta` |
| IoT | `klog-iot` |

## Skills

| Acción | Skill |
|--------|-------|
| Cliente SDK | `klog-feature-sdks` |
| OpenAPI ingesta | `klog-feature-ingesta` |
| ESP32 | `klog-feature-iot` |
| Arquitectura | `klog-arquitectura` |
| Jira/Confluence | `klog-atlassian` |
| Diagramas | `klog-diagramas-confluence` |
| Sync | `klog-sincronizacion-atlassian` |

```bash
python3 ../docs/harness/sync.py
```

## Invariantes

- Confluence `KLOG` / Jira `KL`; backup en repo `docs`.
- Solo ingesta REST.
- UUIDv7; token `klog_…`.
- `201` / `202`; sin reintentos en `400`/`401`/`403`.
- OpenAPI: `https://github.com/kriverdevice/klog-api/blob/main/openapi/ingest.yaml`.
- Docs `klog.krisskira.com` · API `klog-api.krisskira.com`.
- No NATS, ClickHouse, API Node ni RBAC de un solo rol.

Responder en español.
